# ── Personal finance dashboard ──────────────────────────────────
# Raw statements, balances, mortgage terms, generated cleartext payload.
# NOTHING in here is ever committed. Only the AES-encrypted blob in
# public/finances/data.enc.json goes to the public repo.
finance-private/

# NOTE: public/finances/data.enc.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It is tracked,
# and must stay tracked — gitignoring a tracked file does not untrack it, it just
# means `git add -A` silently stages its deletion. The guard against publishing a
# weak or test-encrypted blob is the passphrase entropy check in
# tools/build-finance.mjs, not this file.
